noah-sales: Looping in team for a quick presales ask. Polaris Foods wants a short POC for invoice/receipt parsing with streaming structured output + function calls for tax calculations. They expect ~30k tokens/day. Need a 1-file SDK snippet and a hosted vs dedicated cost ballpark. Any quick notes?

eva-presales: For POC we can do hosted low-latency with batching=0. Will draft a Go SDK example since their infra team prefers Go.

diego-se: Go snippet (streaming + function):
```go
package main
import (
  "fmt"
  "os"
  rw "github.com/redwood/inference-go"
)
func main(){
  client := rw.New(os.Getenv("RW_KEY"))
  stream := client.ChatStream(rw.ChatStreamOpts{
    Model: "redwood-lite-1",
    Messages: []rw.Message{{Role:"user", Content:"Parse invoice PDF to JSON"}},
    Functions: []rw.Function{{Name:"calc_tax", Description:"calculate tax per line"}},
  })
  for ev := range stream.Events(){
    switch ev.Type{
      case rw.EventDelta:
        fmt.Print(ev.Delta)
      case rw.EventFunctionCall:
        // call local tax service
      }
  }
}
```

noah-sales: Good. Pricing guesstimate: 30k/day -> ~900k/mo. Hosted list $0.0003/token => ~$270/mo. Dedicated baseline ~ $2k/mo.

ravi-sec: Polaris needs IP allowlist + SOC2 + live audit logs. For POC recommend scoped API keys + IP allowlist. For prod recommend Dedicated with KMS.

infra-bot: infra-bot: Provision request RDW-7777 created for a test slot. ETA 48h.

eva-presales: I'll run the pricing ask with finance and confirm. Also will include a short README for the Go example explaining how to handle incremental function outputs.

noah-sales: Let's schedule the kickoff Wed 11am PT. EVA will own tech prep.

eva-presales: Invite sent.

diego-se: Quick gotcha: streaming + function calls can interleave deltas and final calls. Recommend the client side assemble function args before posting to downstream webhook to avoid partial results.

noah-sales: Thanks all. If blockers raise before Wed ping here. :ok_hand:
